    {
      "id": "2072208525871530077",
      "text": "Most people use Claude or ChatGPT like a smarter Google. Ask, get an answer, move on.\n\nThe real unlock is using it to build something — not just look things up.\n\nYou don't need to be technical. Pick anything this weekend and build it with AI as your partner.\n\nWe did exactly this — 3 apps shipped to the iOS App Store, now getting subscribers worldwide. No big eng team. Just picking something and building.\n\nThe gap between \"I know how to use AI\" and \"I built something with AI\" is smaller than you think.\n\nPick one thing this weekend. Build it.",
