      "id": "2072173943671165252",
      "text": "I released my first iPhone app 15 years ago. It was called 'Chili Shooter'. It was supposed to be a russian roulette game, but after months of fighting with Apple's app store rules, we changed it so you shoot a bottle of chili sauce on your head, instead of the classic gameplay. I didn't develop it, I designed it, I thought it would be a fun project to use AI to bring back...🧵",
